From 7c41ad66cdc2c4c327885ad0580fb906f210516b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Van Tran <tetcu@fgorg.vn>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:12:58 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(issues): approval panel for the person a workflow step
 waits on

While an issue sits in a step whose handler is the viewer (a member, or the
creator when that is the viewer), the issue page shows an approval panel:
Approve moves it to the step's next status, Send back asks what must change,
posts it as a comment and moves it to the step's back status.

Patch-Id: approval-panel
